  --- crl [Stdlend-sim-cycle-nextEv-last] : < clk(T) [prev: clk(Tprev)] | nil >< nil || {scheduledEvent: time Tnext, args {sgName Stdlsg, value StdlVal} } > << SgSTR | VarSTR | ConstSTR >> # < SgDescSTR > {repeat: SgChangedMap } {wholeExec: SchListCp} InputChangeSim
